          <span>© Baklib. 版权所有</span>
          <a href="https://beian.miit.gov.cn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline">蜀ICP备xxxx号</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</section>

<section class="preset-section rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-base-300 px-6 py-8 md:px-10 md:py-10">
  <!-- hero carousel: https://daisyui.com/components/hero/ -->
  <main>
    <div class="bg-primary/10 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-base-300 px-6 py-8 md:px-10 md:py-10">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-primary mb-2">Resources Portal</p>
        <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-base-content mb-3">数字资源库</h1>
        <p class="text-base text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed">
          集中管理图片、视频、文档等媒体资源，支持多级栏目、标签筛选与权限控制。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</section>

